<title>MOLDOVA: Moldova 28-day T-bills steady, 91-, 273-day down.</title>
<headline>Moldova 28-day T-bills steady, 91-, 273-day down.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The annualised yield on Moldovan 28-day Treasury bills remained steady at 22.54 percent on Tuesday following the previous auction on April 22, the National Bank said.</p>
<p>The yield on 91-day T-bills fell to 25.15 percent from 26.51 percent on April 22.</p>
<p>The yield on 273-day T-bills fell to 27.38 percent from 30.15 percent on April 8.</p>
<p>Full details of the 28-day T-bill auction:</p>
<p>				    April 29	   April 22</p>
<p> Issue volume		   2.00 million lei     2.00 million lei</p>
<p> Denominations		  1,000 lei	  1,000 lei</p>
<p> Nominal demand		 3.42 million	   2.82 million</p>
<p> Volume sold		    2.00 million	   2.00 million</p>
<p> Yield			    22.54 pct	  22.54 pct</p>
<p> Price			    98.3 pct	   98.3 pct</p>
<p> Range of bids		  98.3-99.0 pct    98.3-98.5 pct</p>
<p> Maturity			 June 3, 1997     May 22, 1997</p>
<p>Full details of the 91-days T-bill auction:</p>
<p>				    April 29	   April 22</p>
<p> Issue volume		   16 million lei	 19.00 million lei</p>
<p> Denominations		  1,000 lei	  1,000 lei</p>
<p> Nominal demand		 38.65 million	  41.29 million</p>
<p> Volume sold		    16.00 million	  19.00 million</p>
<p> Yield			    25.15 pct	  26.51 pct</p>
<p> Price			    94.1 pct	   93.8 pct</p>
<p> Range of bids		  94.1-99.9 pct    93.8-94.2 pct</p>
<p> Maturity			 Aug 5, 1997	July 24, 1997</p>
<p>Full details of the 273-days paper auction:</p>
<p>				    April 29	   April 8</p>
<p> Issue volume		   7.00 million lei     4.00 million</p>
<p> Denominations		  1,000 lei	  1,000 lei</p>
<p> Nominal demand		 8.13 million	   2.74 million</p>
<p> Volume sold		    7.00 million	   2.5 million</p>
<p> Yield			    27.38 pct	  30.15 pct</p>
<p> Price			    83.0 pct	   81.6 pct</p>
<p> Range of bids		  83.0-93.0 pct    81.6-82.7 pct</p>
<p> Maturity			 Feb 2, 1998	Jan 8, 1998</p>
